<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
{% include "_style.css.j2" %}
.w-logo { margin-top: 170px; position: relative; }
.w-h1 { font-family: "Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 118px; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-top: 44px; position: relative; }
.w-h1 span { color: var(--accent); display: block; }
.w-sub { font-size: 36px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 34px; line-height: 1.3; position: relative; }
.days { margin-top: 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; position: relative; }
.day { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; }
.day .when { background: var(--accent-2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: "Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--ink); }
.day .when.alt { background: var(--t1); color: var(--bg); }
.day .what { padding: 28px 30px; }
.day .what b { display: block; font-family: "Grotesk"; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; }
.day .what i { font-style: normal; display: block; font-size: 27px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.35; }
.gloss { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; position: relative; }
.term { border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 6px 0 6px 26px; }
.term b { display: block; font-family: "Grotesk"; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; }
.term i { font-style: normal; display: block; font-size: 28px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.35; }
.big-claim { font-family: "Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 124px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-top: 230px; position: relative; }
.big-claim span { color: var(--accent); }
.asks { margin-top: 90px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; position: relative; }
.ask { font-size: 37px; color: var(--ink-2); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
.ask b { color: var(--ink); }
.ask .n { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: "Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set logo %}<svg class="logo" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="30" y="12" width="56" height="56" rx="13" fill="#9D8CFF"></rect><rect x="14" y="32" width="56" height="56" rx="13" fill="#6C5CE7" stroke="#15122E" stroke-width="5"></rect></svg>{% endset %}

<section class="slide">
  <div class="brand">{{ logo }}INDIGO META<span class="wk">BENVENUTO</span></div>
  <svg class="w-logo" width="190" height="190" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="30" y="12" width="56" height="56" rx="13" fill="#9D8CFF"></rect><rect x="14" y="32" width="56" height="56" rx="13" fill="#6C5CE7" stroke="#15122E" stroke-width="5"></rect></svg>
  <div class="w-h1">Benvenuto su<span>Indigo Meta</span></div>
  <div class="w-sub">Il Pokémon TCG competitivo, in italiano.<br>Dati veri, spiegati chiari.</div>
  <div class="swipe">Scorri →</div>
  <div class="foot"><span>{{ handle }}</span><span class="page">1/4</span></div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="brand">{{ logo }}INDIGO META<span class="wk">BENVENUTO</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Cosa trovi qui</div>
  <h2>Ogni settimana</h2>
  <div class="days">
    <div class="day"><div class="when">LUN</div><div class="what"><b>Meta Report</b><i>I mazzi più giocati, la tier list, chi sale e chi scende, la lista vincente carta per carta.</i></div></div>
    <div class="day"><div class="when">MAR</div><div class="what"><b>League Cup</b><i>Tutte le Cup in Italia, regione per regione: trovi subito quella più vicina.</i></div></div>
    <div class="day"><div class="when alt">NEWS</div><div class="what"><b>Appena escono</b><i>Nuove espansioni, carte rivelate, regole e grandi tornei. Dal Giappone, dove tutto arriva prima.</i></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>{{ handle }}</span><span class="page">2/4</span></div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="brand">{{ logo }}INDIGO META<span class="wk">BENVENUTO</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Come leggere i dati</div>
  <h2>Tre numeri da sapere</h2>
  <div class="gloss">
    <div class="term"><b>Meta share</b><i>Quanto è giocato un mazzo: la sua quota sul totale delle liste della settimana.</i></div>
    <div class="term"><b>Tier</b><i>Quanto porta risultati: la quota dei posti in top 8. Popolare non vuol dire forte.</i></div>
    <div class="term"><b>Conversion</b><i>Quante liste di quel mazzo arrivano in top 8. Sopra la media? Il mazzo rende più di quanto si gioca.</i></div>
  </div>
  <div class="method" style="margin-top:46px">I dati arrivano da migliaia di liste dei tornei su <b>Limitless</b>, analizzati ogni settimana in automatico.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span>{{ handle }}</span><span class="page">3/4</span></div>
</section>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="brand">{{ logo }}INDIGO META<span class="wk">BENVENUTO</span></div>
  <div class="big-claim">Niente sensazioni.<br><span>Dati.</span></div>
  <div class="asks">
    <div class="ask"><span class="n">1</span><span><b>Segui</b> {{ handle }} per il report di ogni lunedì</span></div>
    <div class="ask"><span class="n">2</span><span><b>Salva</b> i post con le liste per il prossimo torneo</span></div>
    <div class="ask"><span class="n">3</span><span><b>Scrivi</b> nei commenti cosa giochi adesso</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>Pokémon TCG · Italia</span><span class="page">4/4</span></div>
</section>
</body>
</html>
